[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4144798560","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117846#issuecomment-4144798560","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117846","id":4144798560,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73DJtg","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T19:33:02Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T19:33:02Z","body":"> The list of layouts lacks a visible background, which looks odd. Compare this with other lists, e.g. in the input map editor or project settings.\r\n\r\nBecause it's using scroll hints instead. Those other sections can't use them because their elements don't touch both horizontal borders.\r\n\r\n> I suggest always displaying the Default layout in the list, so the user knows they can overwrite the default layout. It should always appear first in the list, similar to the dropdown where you load a layout. It could be distinguished by naming it Default (override) in the list.\r\n\r\nI added it to the list, but I think the \"(override)\" is unnecessary, since the label below already states that the selected layout is being overridden.\r\n\r\n> The Delete Layout dialog should also display the Default layout first, otherwise you can't reset it to its out-of-the-box state (as stated in the dialog that appears when you override Default).\r\n\r\nDone.\r\n\r\n> To make it less awkward, Default should probably appear as Default (restore to initial state) in the delete dialog.\r\n\r\nI chose to name it \"Default (Restore)\". I think it gets the point across.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4144798560/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4147921099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117846#issuecomment-4147921099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117846","id":4147921099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc73PEDL","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created